                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A short mystery-adventure with a fairly interesting story to unravel and simple puzzles that still made me feel clever for solving them. Does a great job at building tension, and the price while on sale is excellent value for how well everything is presented. There's also some good replay value if you want to find all the hidden endings. Looking forward to seeing more from this studio!",
